url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-06-25T21:39:14Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T21:23:18Z","closed_at":"2026-07-10T21:23:18Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Editing this because I have more clarity into the actual issue\n\nSeems that when launching, godot editor tries to stat all drives, twice.  This check [https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-getvolumeinformationw](url) seems to hang for about 8 seconds before giving up (per drive, x2 per launch)\nIn my case I believe this was because I had a VPN that enabled connectivity of those network drives, but it was only letting godot use the VPN when I ran as administrator, or possibly true access to the network drive was being restricted in another way that admin bypassed.\n\n### Tested versions\n\n- reproducible in 4.7 4.7-beta1 4.7-dev5 4.7-dev4\n- not reproducible in 4.7-dev3 4.7-dev1 4.6.3, 4.6.2, 4.6.1, 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.7084) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1370P (20 threads) - 31.66 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nI also tried compatibility rendering and that did not change the behavior\n\n### Issue description\n\nwhen running the editor, it opens and then after about 1 seconds, which normally is when it is done loading and shows the project list, instead shows the \"not responding\" white bar at the top\nabout 20 seconds later, it will finally load, but it will have an error about fetching the update in red.  Error 13.\n\nWhen opening any project, including creating a blank one.  it will hang for 2-5 minutes before showing something other than the splash screen, and then it works fine.\n\nrunning as administrator does not exhibit any of these problems.\n\nI am worried this has to do with AV or other IT restrictions, but there is a clear difference in behavior between builds\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nrun Godot_v4.7-<something>_win64.exe on a windows 11 system that is behaving like mine is.\n\nIf anyone has a suggestion of additional information I could collect or things to try, please let me know.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis is project agnostic","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120649/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120649/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}